# Generic runtime, log, cache, and secret patterns.
# Exact names above stay. These cover the same kinds of files wherever they appear.
# *.lock is omitted so a skill's yarn.lock / pubspec.lock stays visible (.oauth_refresh.lock* only).
# /*.jsonl is repo-root only so .jsonl files inside skills/ and hooks/ stay tracked.
*.log
*.log.*
*.pid
*.sock
*.tmp
*.tmp.*
*.swp
*~
.oauth_refresh.lock*
.last-*
*-cache.json
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
/*.jsonl
